# The 1 MB body was one backstop for two endpoints, and twenty-two times the
# largest entry either of them takes. Four hundred concurrent 1 MB bodies of
# 22,000 legs held 1,476 MB, all of it refused.

title: the transaction body is the old megabyte backstop again
file: internal/ledgerhttp/transactions.go
run: go test -count=1 -run TestEachEndpointReadsOnlyTheBodyItsOwnBoundsAllow -v ./internal/ledgerhttp/
--- before
const maxTransactionBody = 256 << 10
--- after
const maxTransactionBody = 1 << 20
